   1  * Own transcription of Coleman-Liao problem 5 / CUTEst DTOC5 with coefficient c on h*y^2
   2  * (c=1: source model; c=4: MINLPLib/QPLIB 8585 variant).  y(1)=1, h=1/N.
   5  Set t /1*1000/; Set tt(t); tt(t) = yes$(ord(t) < card(t));
   6  Scalar h; h = 1/1000;
   7  Variables x(t), y(t), f;
   8  Equations obj, dyn(t);
   9  obj.. f =e= h*sum(tt, sqr(y(tt)) + sqr(x(tt)));
